    "\n",
    "Unicode normalization handles width variants, and jieba splits Chinese text into words. Punctuation-only tokens and identifier placeholders are excluded from model inputs. Negation words such as 不 and 没 remain in the text. Exact duplicate token sequences are removed, and token sequences with conflicting labels are excluded. Pattern masking covers common formats and does not guarantee de-identification. Report charts and exported predictions use counts or row IDs rather than full reviews."
